{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102195115400-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102200533\"/><p>少女送院救治。</p><p>今午(2日)5時37分，屯門井財街23號祥隆大廈，一名婦人報案，指其17歲女兒在房間暈倒。</p><p>救護車接報抵達，發現少年已陷入昏迷，沒有任何反應，立刻將她送往屯門醫院救治。據了解，少女有身體病。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:14.142251+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:51:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:32.574924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:31.207900+00:00","content_hash":"127400eabf9268fd9a74e1159c473697309df95c21b178f6f0f9f74e17d7ead3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:14.142251+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}